# TempleDB repo .envrc — auto-activates dev mode when you cd here.
#
# Sourced by direnv (https://direnv.net). When present and allowed
# (`direnv allow` once per file change), sets TEMPLEDB_DEV_MODE=1 so the
# templedb CLI prefers the materialized checkout at
# ~/.config/templedb/checkouts/templedb/src over the frozen nix package.
# Combines with phase-1 (in cli/__init__.py) and phase-2 (in flake.nix)
# to make the checkout the source of truth whenever you're actively
# editing templedb.
#
# Users without direnv: unaffected. Users with direnv but who haven't run
# `direnv allow` here: unaffected until they do.
#
# Design: reports/2026-08-16-nix-profile-staleness-design.html (phase 3).
export TEMPLEDB_DEV_MODE=1
